"  {snaps} Snaps und {flatpaks} Flatpaks, sie bringen ihre Bibliotheken "
"selbst mit"
msgstr ""
"  {snaps} snaps and {flatpaks} flatpaks, they bring their own libraries"

#: dynotiq.py:3176
